---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { newsletterEnabled } from '../config/newsletter';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy – CraveSmart" description="How CraveSmart handles information, advertising cookies, and privacy choices.">
  <section class="bg-white text-gray-900 py-16 md:py-24">
    <article class="prose prose-lg mx-auto px-4 max-w-3xl">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p>CraveSmart provides recipes at www.cravesmart.recipes. This policy describes information used by the website and your privacy choices.</p>

      <h2>Information you provide</h2>
      <p>If you use our contact form, we receive your name, email address, and message to respond to your inquiry. Messages are processed through Resend, our email delivery provider. Please avoid including sensitive information in messages.</p>
      {newsletterEnabled ? (
        <p>If you subscribe to recipe emails, your email address is sent to Kit, our newsletter provider. Kit sends a confirmation email; confirm your subscription to receive recipe emails. You can unsubscribe using the link in those emails. The embedded form connects to Kit and may process technical information, such as your IP address and browser details, to operate the signup form and measure its use. See <a href="https://kit.com/privacy">Kit’s Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
      ) : (
        <p>Newsletter signup is currently unavailable, and this website does not collect newsletter email addresses.</p>
      )}

      <h2>Website services and storage</h2>
      <p>The website is hosted on Vercel. Hosting providers may process technical information such as IP addresses, browser details, and request logs to deliver and secure the site. Recipe pages store your preferred measurement units in your browser's local storage. You can remove this preference by clearing site data in your browser.</p>
      <p>We load fonts from Google Fonts, which requires your browser to connect to Google. See <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy">Google's Privacy Policy</a>, <a href="https://vercel.com/legal/privacy-policy">Vercel's Privacy Policy</a>, and <a href="https://resend.com/legal/privacy-policy">Resend's Privacy Policy</a> for details about these providers.</p>

      <h2>Google Analytics</h2>
      <p>With your permission, we use Google Analytics to measure page visits and affiliate-link clicks, including the recipe or page path, the product label, and the link’s placement. Google Analytics may use cookies and process technical information about your browser and device. We do not include contact-form information, URL query strings, or URL fragments in our custom click events. Analytics does not determine whether Amazon credits a purchase to us.</p>
      <p>You can allow or reject analytics when prompted, and change your choice using “Analytics preferences” in the footer. Rejecting analytics does not affect access to recipes or affiliate links. See <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy">Google’s Privacy Policy</a>.</p>

      <h2>Google AdSense and advertising cookies</h2>
      <p>We use Google AdSense. Third-party vendors, including Google, use cookies to serve ads based on your prior visits to this website or other websites. Google's advertising cookies enable Google and its partners to serve ads based on visits to this site and other sites on the Internet.</p>
      <p>You can manage or opt out of personalized Google advertising in <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads">Google Ads Settings</a>. You can also visit <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/">the Digital Advertising Alliance's choices page</a> to learn about opting out of personalized advertising from participating third-party vendors. Learn <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites">how Google uses information from sites that use its services</a>.</p>
      <p>Where an advertising consent message is shown, use its controls to accept, reject, or manage the purposes offered. Browser settings also let you block or delete cookies. Blocking cookies does not necessarily prevent all advertising.</p>

      <h2>Affiliate links and other websites</h2>
      <p>Some links are affiliate or tracking links, and we may earn a commission from qualifying purchases. If you follow a link to another website, that website's privacy policy applies to information it collects.</p>

      <h2>Privacy questions and requests</h2>
      <p>Depending on where you live, you may have rights concerning your personal information, including access, correction, or deletion. To ask about your information or make a privacy request, <a href="/contact">contact CraveSmart</a>. We may need information to verify and respond to your request.</p>

      <h2>Policy changes</h2>
      <p>We may update this page when the website's services or information practices change.</p>
    </article>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
